# Typed lazy selection within pure functions and list pipelines.
define function absolute taking n as number to (if (n is less than 0) then (minus n) otherwise n).
let readings be a list of minus 3, 0, 7, minus 4.
let magnitudes be map every value in readings to (invoke absolute to value).
assert first of magnitudes is equal to 3.
assert last of magnitudes is equal to 4.
print magnitudes.
